# Which optional parts Compose starts; join several with commas (COMPOSE_PROFILES=monitoring,mpa).
# - monitoring: this project's own VictoriaMetrics, VictoriaLogs, Grafana, vmalert and Alertmanager
#   (the bundled mode). Remove it to send metrics and logs to another server instead: see
#   VM_REMOTE_WRITE_URL and VLOGS_URL below.
# - host-monitoring: node-exporter and cAdvisor, which watch the whole host. Leave off on a server
#   whose host already has its own monitoring.
# - mpa: the public website (apps/mpa) at MPA_DOMAIN.
# - admin: the operator area (apps/admin) at ADMIN_DOMAIN.
# - backup: a daily backup of the database; needs the BACKUP_* variables below (docs/backups.md).
# - files: the bundled file store, Garage (docs/files.md). Remove it to keep files in another S3
#   store instead: see S3_ENDPOINT below.
COMPOSE_PROFILES=age64:
# With the mpa profile: the website's own host, next to the SPA at DOMAIN (same server, same API).
# The MPA refuses to start without it. The API and the worker read it too, for the links they make
# to the website (the blog newsletter's mails, the catalog's tracking links, the admin app's "View
# on website"): leave it empty unless the website runs at that host, or those links lead nowhere.
MPA_DOMAIN=age64:YWdlLWVuY3J5cHRpb24ub3JnL3YxCi0+IFgyNTUxOSBidTdMdGNpWm5ZSU5keWJTTW01cG9nWjFMTWVwZkthbHoraldmc05EWFR3CnE0SDV0TFU4ekg1UjBNTUhCSVVSWDAvWlpnSE05R1hVUnpvQWt4dGxLaUkKLS0tIFYwQWEreTZRbVZWVXBxMmorNUJ1SVNMV3dDZCtSZ3BpWFA2bkZDTUlqN0UK3i33hWYzKsc33CQg68t4ydniQkMX1XqczFm/sSkoBVImeIIwXiXjUmLs6Q==
# Production only, optional: a Traefik rule for hosts that answer a permanent redirect to the same
# path on MPA_DOMAIN, such as the www host. Join hosts with ||:
# MPA_REDIRECT_RULE=Host(`www.example.com`) || Host(`old.example.com`). Each host needs a DNS
# record pointing at the server; Traefik gets its certificate. Empty matches nothing.
MPA_REDIRECT_RULE=age64:
# With the mpa profile, optional: the website's visitor statistics in a self-hosted Umami
# (docs/analytics.md). Both or neither; empty loads no tracker. The website id is public. The
# admin app's Stats page reads this website's numbers with UMAMI_API_URL and UMAMI_API_TOKEN below.
# MPA_UMAMI_ORIGIN=https://stats.example.com
# MPA_UMAMI_WEBSITE_ID=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
MPA_UMAMI_ORIGIN=age64:
MPA_UMAMI_WEBSITE_ID=age64:
# Optional: the website's IndexNow key, 8 to 128 letters, digits and dashes (docs/blog.md). With
# MPA_DOMAIN, the worker tells IndexNow when a blog post or a catalog item (docs/catalog.md) goes
# live, changes, moves or leaves, and the website serves the key at /<key>.txt. Public by design;
# make your own. Empty: off.
# INDEXNOW_KEY=<32 hex characters>
INDEXNOW_KEY=age64:YWdlLWVuY3J5cHRpb24ub3JnL3YxCi0+IFgyNTUxOSBYTGxIODlDU29JMDdxSjB0UXRkd2RKMjcwYk1yOHFCQWcwdi9RUmdKKzJrCk56aHlFT2ozbk95ZXQ3enJhTWNiUmtRSGxXTE1MakRSSDFlYWFBWWlQbEkKLS0tIEcyVjRRUFVMMmJWZ3ZTR2JCMXpUUVF2ZTV3ek1FWVFyOTRwUCs5VjZGQjQKDWl2yG6NgFpG8wqryurepLZUtf5gl2f3mKkZ46TL0+4=
# With the mpa profile, optional: a demo deployment of its own (docs/demo.md), an https origin.
