# Monitoring (docs/stack.md, "Monitoring"). vmagent and Vector always run and send this project's
# metrics and logs somewhere. Bundled mode: keep `monitoring` in COMPOSE_PROFILES and leave the six
# values below empty; they then send to the VictoriaMetrics and VictoriaLogs containers of this
# project. External mode: take `monitoring` out of COMPOSE_PROFILES and name the other server here.
# VM_REMOTE_WRITE_URL is the full remote-write address, such as
# https://metrics.example.com/api/v1/write. VLOGS_URL is the VictoriaLogs base address, such as
# https://logs.example.com. The user names and passwords are for HTTP basic auth; leave them empty
# for a server that asks for none.
