# Tracking links (docs/catalog.md, "Tracking links"): one short link per item and place you share
# it in, at https://<MPA_DOMAIN>/s/<code>. On with the catalog once MPA_DOMAIN is set.
# CATALOG_ITEM_PATH is the website's item address, with {category} and {slug} (default
# /{category}/{slug}). With UMAMI_API_URL (your self-hosted Umami, such as
# https://stats.example.com) and UMAMI_API_TOKEN (a token from its POST /api/auth/login; a secret,
# never logged), Umami counts every click; set both or neither. Without them links go straight to
# the item, still tagged with utm_source. The same two, with MPA_UMAMI_WEBSITE_ID above, turn on
# the admin app's Stats page (docs/analytics.md, "Stats in the admin app"); the token's user must
# be able to view that website.
