# Exchange rates (docs/financy/exchange-rates.md): the worker stores the ECB's daily rates at 16:00
# UTC through Frankfurter, which needs no key. RATES_FRANKFURTER_URL points at a self-hosted
# Frankfurter; empty means https://api.frankfurter.dev. The paid fallback (exchangerate-api.com)
# rates the main currencies the ECB lacks, and is off while RATES_FALLBACK_KEY is empty. With the
# key set, RATES_FALLBACK_MONTHLY_CAP is required: the most calls in one calendar month, 0 to
# 1000000; the worker refuses to start without it. Its rates never leave the server.
RATES_FRANKFURTER_URL=age64:YWdlLWVuY3J5cHRpb24ub3JnL3YxCi0+IFgyNTUxOSBObW9ILzRJTVRnVVFZN1pQajU1Wnh4WWc5WDJoUERsZGVGNDZVUTRWQ1ZBCjFkSGRJa0p4QnRzV0w0dXRVWWducTQyTEdObmgwWXZGeWhSMzlBaXduTDQKLS0tIEJydFFEQlFONzZHQlBQS2R4d04wd1FzVllGVU9UVDNOYWphVzUwNXp5MXcKH8T7TjqMLFz1WCjBY0dmCab2ojB+y3CjmK+cU1hd0gk=
